Distributed login attempts across many accounts from a single IP.

IdentityLogonEvents
| where ActionType == "LogonFailed"
| summarize AffectedAccounts=dcount(AccountUpn),
            Failures=count()
  by IPAddress, bin(Timestamp, 1h)
| where AffectedAccounts > 20 and Failures > 50
| order by AffectedAccounts desc
